#: ../../source/compilation.rst:8
msgid "Compilation and Export"
msgstr "编译与导出"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:10
msgid ""
"When a kernel function marked with :py:class:`@ct.kernel "
"<cuda.tile.kernel>` is launched using :py:func:`ct.launch() "
"<cuda.tile.launch>`, it is specialized and compiled just in time (JIT) "
"for the concrete launch arguments. It is also possible to compile a "
"kernel ahead of time (AOT) and export it as a CUDA binary (cubin) file, "
"or as a TileIR bytecode file."
msgstr ""
"当使用 :py:func:`ct.launch() <cuda.tile.launch>` 启动带有 :py:class:`@ct.kernel "
"<cuda.tile.kernel>` "
"装饰器的内核函数时，内核会针对具体的启动参数进行即时（JIT）特化与编译。此外，还可以对内核进行预先（AOT）编译，并将其导出为 CUDA "
"二进制（cubin）文件或 TileIR 字节码文件。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:15
msgid ""
"While just-in-time compilation provides the convenience of automatic "
"kernel specialization, ahead-of-time compilation requires the user to "
"precisely describe the arguments for which the kernel is being compiled, "
"including their types and additional constraints (assumptions) imposed on"
" their values."
msgstr "即时编译提供了自动内核特化的便利，而预先编译则要求用户精确描述内核所针对编译的参数，包括参数类型以及施加在参数值上的额外约束（假设）。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:20
msgid ""
"The main API entry point for ahead-of-time compilation is "
":py:func:`cuda.tile.compilation.export_kernel`:"
msgstr "预先编译的主要 API 入口点是 :py:func:`cuda.tile.compilation.export_kernel` ："

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:1 of
msgid "Compile and export a kernel."
msgstr "编译并导出内核。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:3 of
msgid "A kernel function to export."
msgstr "要导出的内核函数。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:5 of
msgid "A non-empty list of signatures for which to compile the kernel."
msgstr "用于编译内核的非空签名列表。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:7 of
msgid ""
"Either a filename or a binary file-like object to write the output to. To"
" save the result in memory, you can pass an instance of the `io.BytesIO` "
"standard library class."
msgstr "用于写入输出结果的文件路径或二进制类文件对象。如需将结果保存在内存中，可传入标准库类 ``io.BytesIO`` 的实例。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:11 of
msgid ""
"Name of the target GPU for which to compile the kernel (e.g., "
"`\"sm_100\"`). Required when `output_format` is `\"cubin\"`. It can be "
"set to `None` when `output_format` is `\"tileir_bytecode\"` to export "
"architecture-independent bytecode (requires a bytecode version of "
"\"13.3\" or later)."
msgstr ""
"要编译内核的目标 GPU 架构名称（例如 ``\"sm_100\"`` ）。当 ``output_format`` 为 ``\"cubin\"``"
" 时为必填项；当 ``output_format`` 为 ``\"tileir_bytecode\"`` 时可设为 ``None`` "
"以导出与架构无关的字节码（要求字节码版本为 \"13.3\" 或更高）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:16 of
msgid ""
"Set to \"cubin\" to export a CUDA binary file, or \"tileir_bytecode\" to "
"export a TileIR bytecode file."
msgstr ""
"设为 ``\"cubin\"`` 以导出 CUDA 二进制文件，或设为 ``\"tileir_bytecode\"`` 以导出 TileIR "
"字节码文件。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._export.export_kernel:19 of
msgid ""
"Set to `None` to automatically detect the latest TileIR bytecode version "
"supported by the compiler (default). Otherwise, it must be a string of "
"the form \"major.minor\" that specifies the version of the TileIR "
"bytecode to use (e.g., \"13.1\")."
msgstr ""
"设为 ``None`` 时自动检测编译器支持的最新 TileIR 字节码版本（默认）。否则必须传入形如 ``\"major.minor\"`` "
"的字符串来指定要使用的 TileIR 字节码版本（例如 ``\"13.1\"`` ）。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:27
msgid "Kernel Signatures"
msgstr "内核签名"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:28
msgid ""
"There are two ways to construct a :py:class:`KernelSignature` object for "
"use with :py:func:`export_kernel`. The recommended way is to do it "
"explicitly, by instantiating a :py:class:`KernelSignature` object and "
"providing a list of manually constructed :py:class:`ParameterConstraint` "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"有两种方式可以构造供 :py:func:`export_kernel` 使用的 :py:class:`KernelSignature` "
"对象。推荐的做法是显式构造：实例化一个 :py:class:`KernelSignature` 对象，并传入手动构造的 "
":py:class:`ParameterConstraint` 对象列表。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:33
msgid ""
"Alternatively, one may use :py:meth:`KernelSignature.from_kernel_args` to"
" obtain a signature that would be used if the kernel was compiled just-"
"in-time for the given example arguments. While convenient, this approach "
"may create undesired assumptions on kernel parameters. For example, if "
"the base address of an example array argument happens to be divisible by "
"16, an assumption may be made that it will always be so. Launching the "
"exported kernel with an array that doesn't satisfy this assumption would "
"then result in undefined behavior. It is therefore recommended to limit "
"the use of this approach to testing or prototyping."
msgstr ""
"另一种方式是使用 :py:meth:`KernelSignature.from_kernel_args` "
"，直接根据给定的示例参数获取内核即时编译时会生成的签名。这种方法虽然便捷，但可能会对内核参数引入非预期的隐式假设。例如，若示例数组参数的基地址恰好能被"
" 16 "
"整除，编译器可能会假定该地址在所有调用中始终如此对齐；随后若使用不满足该假设的数组启动导出的内核，就会导致未定义行为。因此建议仅在测试或原型验证阶段使用该方法。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:1 of
msgid "Signature of a compiled kernel."
msgstr "已编译内核的签名。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:3 of
msgid ""
"For each parameter of the kernel's Python function, a corresponding "
":py:class:`ParameterConstraint` instance.  Possible constraint classes "
"are: :py:class:`ScalarConstraint`, :py:class:`PointerConstraint`, "
":py:class:`ArrayConstraint`, :py:class:`ListConstraint`, "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint`, :py:class:`ConstantConstraint`, "
":py:class:`DataclassConstraint`.  A plain :py:class:`ConstantValue` (for "
"example, a literal ``10``), can be used as shorthand for "
":py:class:`ConstantConstraint` wrapping the given value. Similarly, a "
"plain ``tuple`` is shorthand for a :py:class:`TupleConstraint` .  Each "
"constraint must be compatible with annotations on the corresponding "
"kernel parameter. For example, if a parameter is marked with "
":py:class:`ct.Constant <cuda.tile.Constant>`, then the corresponding "
"constraint must be a :py:class:`ConstantConstraint`, or a nested "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint` thereof (or a plain value according to the "
"shorthand notation described above)."
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:3 of
msgid ""
"For each parameter of the kernel's Python function, a corresponding "
":py:class:`ParameterConstraint` instance."
msgstr "对应于内核 Python 函数中每个参数的 :py:class:`ParameterConstraint` 实例。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:6 of
msgid ""
"Possible constraint classes are: :py:class:`ScalarConstraint`, "
":py:class:`PointerConstraint`, :py:class:`ArrayConstraint`, "
":py:class:`ListConstraint`, :py:class:`TupleConstraint`, "
":py:class:`ConstantConstraint`, :py:class:`DataclassConstraint`."
msgstr ""
"可用的约束类包括： :py:class:`ScalarConstraint` 、 :py:class:`PointerConstraint` 、 "
":py:class:`ArrayConstraint` 、 :py:class:`ListConstraint` 、 "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint` 、 :py:class:`ConstantConstraint` 、 "
":py:class:`DataclassConstraint` 。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:11 of
msgid ""
"A plain :py:class:`ConstantValue` (for example, a literal ``10``), can be"
" used as shorthand for :py:class:`ConstantConstraint` wrapping the given "
"value. Similarly, a plain ``tuple`` is shorthand for a "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint` ."
msgstr ""
"普通 :py:class:`ConstantValue` （例如字面量 ``10`` ）可用作包裹该值的 "
":py:class:`ConstantConstraint` 简写。同理，普通 ``tuple`` 可用作 "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint` 的简写。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:15 of
msgid ""
"Each constraint must be compatible with annotations on the corresponding "
"kernel parameter. For example, if a parameter is marked with "
":py:class:`ct.Constant <cuda.tile.Constant>`, then the corresponding "
"constraint must be a :py:class:`ConstantConstraint`, or a nested "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint` thereof (or a plain value according to the "
"shorthand notation described above)."
msgstr ""
"每个约束都必须与对应内核参数上的注解兼容。例如，若参数标记有 :py:class:`ct.Constant "
"<cuda.tile.Constant>` ，则对应的约束必须是 :py:class:`ConstantConstraint` ，或由其组成的嵌套"
" :py:class:`TupleConstraint` （或按上述简写规则表示的普通值）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:21
#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:20 of
msgid "|Calling convention| to use."
msgstr "要使用的 |Calling convention| 。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature:23 of
msgid ""
"Symbol name to use for the exported kernel. Set to `None` to "
"automatically generate it from the Python function name and this "
"signature, using a name mangling algorithm defined by the selected "
"calling convention."
msgstr ""
"用于导出内核的符号名称。设为 ``None`` 时，将根据所选调用约定的名称修饰（name mangling）算法，由 Python "
"函数名和此签名自动生成。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.with_mangled_symbol:1 of
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of `self` with the `symbol` attribute replaced with a "
"mangled name."
msgstr "返回 ``self`` 的副本，其中 ``symbol`` 属性被替换为经名称修饰（mangled）后的符号名。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.with_mangled_symbol:3 of
msgid "Function name to use as the base of the mangled symbol."
msgstr "用作修饰后符号名称基础的函数名。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:27
#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.with_mangled_symbol:6
#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.with_symbol:6 of
msgid "KernelSignature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/compilation.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.with_symbol:1 of
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of `self` with the `symbol` attribute replaced with the "
"given value."
msgstr "返回 ``self`` 的副本，其中 ``symbol`` 属性被替换为给定值。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.with_symbol:3 of
msgid "The new symbol name."
msgstr "新的符号名称。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:1 of
msgid ""
"Returns the signature that would be used if the kernel was compiled just-"
"in-time for the given arguments.o"
msgstr "返回针对给定参数即时编译内核时将使用的签名。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:6 of
msgid ""
"It is recommended to limit the use of this function to testing or "
"prototyping. Deriving a kernel signature from example arguments may "
"create unexpected assumptions on kernel parameters."
msgstr "建议仅在测试或原型开发中使用此函数。基于示例参数推导内核签名可能会引入意料之外的参数假设。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:10 of
msgid ""
"For example, if the base address of an example array argument happens to "
"be divisible by 16, an assumption may be made that it will always be so. "
"Launching the exported kernel with an array that doesn't satisfy this "
"assumption would result in undefined behavior."
msgstr "例如，若示例数组参数的基地址恰好可被 16 整除，编译器可能会假定该地址始终如此对齐。若用不满足此假设的数组启动导出的内核，将导致未定义行为。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:15 of
msgid ""
"A kernel function decorated with :py:class:`@ct.kernel "
"<cuda.tile.kernel>`."
msgstr "带有 :py:class:`@ct.kernel <cuda.tile.kernel>` 装饰器的内核函数。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:17 of
msgid ""
"Tuple of kernel arguments, as if it were be passed to "
":py:func:`ct.launch() <cuda.tile.launch>`."
msgstr "内核参数元组，格式与传递给 :py:func:`ct.launch() <cuda.tile.launch>` 的参数一致。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.KernelSignature.from_kernel_args:22 of
msgid ""
"Specifies the `symbol` attribute of the returned signature. If set to "
"`None`, the returned symbol will be automatically filled using a name "
"mangling algorithm defined by the selected |calling convention|."
msgstr ""
"指定返回签名的 ``symbol`` 属性。若设为 ``None`` ，将使用所选 |calling convention| "
"定义的名称修饰算法自动生成符号名。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:45
msgid ""
"The :py:class:`ParameterConstraint` type alias is used as a type hint for"
" a kernel parameter constraint:"
msgstr "类型别名 :py:class:`ParameterConstraint` 用作内核参数约束的类型提示："

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ScalarConstraint:1 of
msgid ""
"Describes a scalar kernel parameter and associated compile-time "
"assumptions."
msgstr "描述标量内核参数及其关联的编译期假设。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ScalarConstraint:3 of
msgid "Data type of the scalar."
msgstr "标量的数据类型。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:1 of
msgid ""
"Describes an array kernel parameter and associated compile-time "
"assumptions."
msgstr "描述数组内核参数及其关联的编译期假设。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:3 of
msgid "Data type of the array."
msgstr "数组的数据类型。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:5 of
msgid "Number of dimensions of the array, also known as rank."
msgstr "数组的维度数量，也称为秩（rank）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:7 of
msgid ""
"Data type used to represent array's shape, strides and indices. Supported"
" values are :py:data:`ct.int32 <cuda.tile.int32>` and :py:data:`ct.int64 "
"<cuda.tile.int64>`. Using ``int64`` enables support for arrays whose "
"shape or stride values exceed the range of a 32-bit integer."
msgstr ""
"用于表示数组形状、步长和索引的数据类型。支持的值为 :py:data:`ct.int32 <cuda.tile.int32>` 和 "
":py:data:`ct.int64 <cuda.tile.int64>` 。使用 ``int64`` 可支持形状或步长超出 32 "
"位整数范围的数组。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:12 of
msgid ""
"For each dimension of the array, an optional inclusive lower bound for "
"its stride. If all dimensions have the same lower bound, a single number "
"can be passed instead of a sequence. For example, passing `0` specifies "
"that all strides are non-negative."
msgstr "数组每个维度的可选步长包含式下界。如果所有维度具有相同的下界，可传入单个数字代替序列。例如，传入 ``0`` 表示所有步长均非负。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:17 of
msgid ""
"When set to an empty sequence, specifies that this array may not alias "
"any other parameter. Otherwise, it must be a sequence of arbitrary "
"strings, referred to as \"alias groups\". Two parameters are allowed to "
"alias each other if and only if they have an alias group in common."
msgstr ""
"当设为空序列时，表示该数组不得与任何其他参数存在内存别名（alias）。否则，它必须是由任意字符串组成的序列，称为“别名组（alias "
"groups）”。当且仅当两个参数共享至少一个别名组时，它们之间才允许存在别名关系。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:22 of
msgid ""
"Indicates whether two distinct in-bounds indices are allowed to point to "
"the same memory location. For example, this can happen if the array has a"
" zero stride. For most arrays produced by major tensor libraries, this "
"can be assumed to be false. Setting this to True may disable certain "
"optimizations of loads and stores to/from this array."
msgstr ""
"指示是否允许两个不同的有效界内索引指向同一内存位置（例如当数组存在零步长时）。对于主流张量库生成的绝大多数数组，通常可假定该值为 "
"False。将其设为 True 可能会禁用针对该数组加载与存储操作的某些优化。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:28 of
msgid ""
"For each dimension of the array, an optional constant value of its "
"stride. For example, if the array is known to have a C-contiguous layout,"
" the stride of the last dimension can be set to 1, which may enable "
"certain optimizations of loads and stores from/to this array. Can be set "
"to `None` if none of the dimensions have known strides (this is the "
"default)."
msgstr ""
"数组每个维度的可选常量步长值。例如，若已知数组为 C 连续布局，可将最后一维的步长设为 "
"1，以启用针对该数组加载与存储操作的特定优化。若各维度均无已知步长，可设为 ``None`` （默认值）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:34 of
msgid ""
"For each dimension of the array, an optional constant value of its shape."
" Can be set to `None` if none of the dimensions have known shapes. "
"Requires ``cutile_python_v2``. If ``shape_constant[i]`` is set, "
"``shape_divisible_by[i]`` is redundant and must be compatible (i.e., "
"``shape_constant[i]`` must be divisible by ``shape_divisible_by[i]``); it"
" is then ignored."
msgstr ""
"数组每个维度的可选常量形状值。若各维度均无已知形状，可设为 ``None`` 。需要 ``cutile_python_v2`` 。若已设置 "
"``shape_constant[i]`` ，则 ``shape_divisible_by[i]`` 属于冗余设定但仍需保持兼容（即 "
"``shape_constant[i]`` 必须能被 ``shape_divisible_by[i]`` 整除），随后将被忽略。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:41 of
msgid ""
"For each dimension of the array, a factor by which its stride is assumed "
"to be divisible. The value is given in array elements, not bytes. For "
"example, a value of `8` for a `float16` array indicates divisibility by "
"16 bytes, since each element of the array is 2 bytes wide. Value of 1 "
"indicates that no assumption is made regarding the stride divisibility "
"(this is the default)."
msgstr ""
"数组每个维度步长所假设的整除因子，单位为数组元素数而非字节数。例如，对 ``float16`` 数组指定 ``8`` 表示可被 16 "
"字节整除（因每个元素占 2 字节）。取值为 1 表示不对步长整除性做任何假设（默认值）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:48 of
msgid ""
"For each dimension of the array, a factor by which its length is assumed "
"to be divisible. The value is given in array elements, not bytes. For "
"example, a value of `8` for a `float16` array indicates divisibility by "
"16 bytes, since each element of the array is 2 bytes wide. Value of 1 "
"indicates that no assumption is made regarding the shape divisibility "
"(this is the default)."
msgstr ""
"数组每个维度长度所假设的整除因子，单位为数组元素数而非字节数。例如，对 ``float16`` 数组指定 ``8`` 表示可被 16 "
"字节整除（因每个元素占 2 字节）。取值为 1 表示不对形状长度整除性做任何假设（默认值）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ArrayConstraint:55 of
msgid ""
"Factor by which the array's base address is assumed to be divisible. "
"Value of 1 indicates that no assumption is made regarding the base "
"address divisibility (this is the default)."
msgstr "假定数组基地址可整除的对齐因子（单位为字节）。取值为 1 表示不对基地址对齐做任何假设（默认值）。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ListConstraint:1 of
msgid "Describes a list kernel parameter and associated compile-time assumptions."
msgstr "描述列表内核参数及其关联的编译期假设。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ListConstraint:3 of
msgid ""
"Describes the element of this list. Currently, this must be an "
"`ArrayConstraint`, since only lists of arrays are supported as kernel "
"arguments."
msgstr "描述该列表的元素约束。当前必须为 ``ArrayConstraint`` ，因为内核参数仅支持数组列表。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ListConstraint:6 of
msgid ""
"Describes which other parameters the storage of this list is allowed to "
"alias. Note that this is different from ``element.alias_groups``, which "
"sets aliasing assumptions on the list elements. When set to an empty "
"sequence, specifies that this list may not alias any other parameter. "
"Otherwise, it must be a sequence of arbitrary strings, referred to as "
"\"alias groups\". Two parameters are allowed to alias each other if and "
"only if they have an alias group in common."
msgstr ""
"描述该列表自身存储区允许与哪些其他参数产生内存别名。请注意，这与用于设置列表元素别名假设的 ``element.alias_groups`` "
"不同。当设为空序列时，表示该列表不得与任何其他参数存在别名；否则必须是由任意字符串组成的序列（称为“别名组”）。当且仅当两个参数共享至少一个别名组时，它们之间才允许存在别名关系。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ListConstraint:14 of
msgid ""
"Specifies whether two distinct elements of this list are allowed to alias"
" each other."
msgstr "指定该列表中的两个不同元素是否允许互为内存别名。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.TupleConstraint:1 of
msgid "Describes a tuple kernel parameter."
msgstr "描述元组内核参数。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.TupleConstraint:3 of
msgid "Per-item constraints."
msgstr "逐元素的参数约束。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ConstantConstraint:1 of
msgid "Specifies the compile-time value of a kernel parameter or aggregate field."
msgstr "指定内核参数或聚合类型字段的编译期常量值。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ConstantConstraint:3 of
msgid ""
"A constant constraint makes an unannotated parameter or field constant. A"
" parameter marked with :py:class:`ct.Constant <cuda.tile.Constant>` must "
"likewise receive a constant constraint."
msgstr ""
"常量约束会使未加注解的参数或字段成为常量；同理，标注了 :py:class:`ct.Constant <cuda.tile.Constant>` "
"的参数也必须接收常量约束。"

#: cuda.tile.compilation._signature.ConstantConstraint:7 of
msgid "The value of the compile-time constant."
msgstr "编译期常量的具体取值。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:66
msgid "Calling Conventions"
msgstr "调用约定"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:67
msgid ""
"A calling convention defines three aspects of the binary interface "
"provided by an exported kernel:"
msgstr "调用约定定义了导出内核所提供的二进制接口的三个方面："

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:69
msgid ""
"The binary format and the order of kernel arguments, e.g. as passed to "
"the ``cuLaunchKernel()`` CUDA Driver API function."
msgstr "内核参数的二进制布局格式与传递顺序，例如传递给 ``cuLaunchKernel()`` CUDA Driver API 函数时的参数。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:71
msgid "The set of supported parameter constraints."
msgstr "所支持的参数约束集合。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:72
msgid ""
"The name mangling algorithm used to automatically derive a symbol name "
"from the kernel's function name and a kernel signature."
msgstr "用于根据内核函数名和内核签名自动推导出符号名称的名称修饰（name mangling）算法。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:75
msgid ""
"Two calling conventions are available: ``cutile_python_v1`` and "
"``cutile_python_v2``. Both pass binary kernel arguments in the same order"
" as the kernel parameters are declared in the Python kernel function, "
"except that parameters annotated with :py:class:`ct.Constant "
"<cuda.tile.Constant>` are omitted. ``cutile_python_v2`` extends "
"``cutile_python_v1`` with support for tuple parameters "
"(:py:class:`TupleConstraint`) and static shapes (the ``shape_constant`` "
"field of :py:class:`ArrayConstraint`). New code should use "
"``cutile_python_v2``."
msgstr ""
"目前提供两种调用约定： ``cutile_python_v1`` 和 ``cutile_python_v2`` 。两者均按 Python "
"内核函数中参数声明的顺序传递二进制内核参数，但会省略标注了 :py:class:`ct.Constant "
"<cuda.tile.Constant>` 的参数。 ``cutile_python_v2`` 在 ``cutile_python_v1`` "
"基础上增加了对元组参数（ :py:class:`TupleConstraint` ）和静态形状（ "
":py:class:`ArrayConstraint` 的 ``shape_constant`` 字段）的支持。新代码应优先使用 "
"``cutile_python_v2`` 。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:83
msgid ""
"The following table lists the supported parameter constraints and their "
"binary formats. Constraints marked |v2only| require ``cutile_python_v2``."
msgstr "下表列出了受支持的参数约束及其二进制格式。标注有 |v2only| 的约束要求使用 ``cutile_python_v2`` 。"

