#: ../../source/compilation.rst:94
msgid ":py:class:`ScalarConstraint`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:95
msgid ""
"Passed as a single argument of the corresponding type. For example, if "
"the constraint's `dtype` is :py:data:`ct.int32 <cuda.tile.int32>`, the "
"corresponding C type is ``int32_t``; :py:data:`ct.float64 "
"<cuda.tile.float64>` corresponds to C's ``double`` and so on."
msgstr ""
"按对应类型的单个参数传入。例如，若约束的 ``dtype`` 为 :py:data:`ct.int32 <cuda.tile.int32>` "
"，则对应的 C 类型为 ``int32_t`` ； :py:data:`ct.float64 <cuda.tile.float64>` 对应 C "
"语言的 ``double`` ，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:99
msgid ":py:class:`ArrayConstraint`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:100
msgid ""
"Passed as `1 + 2n` arguments, where `n` is the number of dimensions "
"(`ndim`) of the array. The first argument is the device pointer to the "
"base of the array's data. It is followed by `n` arguments representing "
"the shape of the array. Finally, the last `n` arguments represent the "
"strides of the array. The type of shape and stride arguments is "
"determined by the ``index_dtype`` field of the constraint:"
msgstr ""
"按 ``1 + 2n`` 个参数传入，其中 ``n`` 为数组的维度数（ ``ndim`` "
"）。第一个参数是指向数组数据基地址的设备指针；紧随其后的是 ``n`` 个表示数组形状的参数；最后是 ``n`` "
"个表示数组步长的参数。形状与步长参数的类型由约束的 ``index_dtype`` 字段决定："

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:107
msgid "The ``shape_constant`` field |v2only| requires ``cutile_python_v2``."
msgstr "``shape_constant`` 字段 |v2only| 需要 ``cutile_python_v2`` 。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:112
msgid "Constraint's ``index_dtype``"
msgstr "约束的 ``index_dtype``"

