#: ../../source/compilation.rst:124
msgid ":py:class:`ListConstraint` with an :py:class:`ArrayConstraint` element"
msgstr "包含 :py:class:`ArrayConstraint` 元素的 :py:class:`ListConstraint`"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:125
msgid ""
"Passed as two arguments: a device pointer to the base of the list data "
"and an ``int32_t`` denoting the length of the list. The base pointer must"
" point to an 8-byte aligned contiguous buffer in the global GPU memory, "
"consisting of `(1 + 2n) * L` 64-bit words, where `L` is the length of the"
" list and `n` is the `ndim` of the element array constraint. Each element"
" array of the list is represented by `(1 + 2n)` words in this buffer. The"
" first word stores a device pointer to the base of array; the next `n` "
"signed integers store the shape of the array; the final `n` signed "
"integers store the strides of the array. Even though 64-bit integers are "
"always used for the shape and the strides, they are truncated to the "
"``index_dtype`` of the element constraint."
msgstr ""
"按两个参数传入：指向列表数据基地址的设备指针，以及一个表示列表长度的 ``int32_t`` 。基指针必须指向 GPU 全局内存中一块 8 "
"字节对齐的连续缓冲区，其中包含 ``(1 + 2n) * L`` 个 64 位字（word），``L`` 为列表长度， ``n`` "
"为元素数组约束的 ``ndim`` 。列表中的每个元素数组在该缓冲区中由 ``(1 + 2n)`` 个字表示：第 1 "
"个字存储指向数组基地址的设备指针；随后的 ``n`` 个有符号整数存储数组形状；最后的 ``n`` "
"个有符号整数存储数组步长。尽管缓冲区中形状和步长始终以 64 位整数存储，但使用时会截断为元素约束的 ``index_dtype`` 。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:136
msgid ":py:class:`TupleConstraint` |v2only|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:137
msgid ""
"The tuple's elements are passed as consecutive arguments, as if each "
"element were an individual top-level parameter. The binary format of each"
" element follows the same rules as its corresponding constraint type. "
"Elements may be scalars, arrays, lists of arrays, constants, or nested "
"tuples. Constants are omitted and nested tuples are flattened "
"recursively."
msgstr "元组中的各个元素会作为连续参数依次传递，就像每个元素都是独立的顶层参数一样。每个元素的二进制格式遵循其对应约束类型的规则。元素可以是标量、数组、数组列表、常量或嵌套元组。常量会被省略，嵌套元组则会递归展平。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:143
msgid ""
"When the tuple parameter is annotated with :py:class:`ct.Constant[tuple] "
"<cuda.tile.Constant>`, the entire tuple is omitted from the launch "
"arguments (same as :py:class:`ConstantConstraint`). In this case, all "
"leaf elements of the :py:class:`TupleConstraint` must be "
":py:class:`ConstantConstraint`."
msgstr ""
"当元组参数标注为 :py:class:`ct.Constant[tuple] <cuda.tile.Constant>` "
"时，整个元组会从启动参数中省略（与 :py:class:`ConstantConstraint` 相同）。在此情况下， "
":py:class:`TupleConstraint` 的所有叶子元素都必须是 :py:class:`ConstantConstraint` 。"

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:149
msgid ":py:class:`ConstantConstraint`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/compilation.rst:150
msgid "Omitted from the launch arguments."
msgstr "从启动参数中省略。"

